# GRIMs-NEMO

**GRIMs-NEMO** is a coupled climate modeling system that integrates 
the **GRIMs atmospheric model** with the **NEMO ocean model**.
This top-level repository organizes the full modeling system using Git submodules.

---

## Repository Structure

This repository includes the following Git submodules:

1. GRIMs-libs
  Path: ./GRIMs/libs
  URL: https://github.com/GRIMs-NEMO/GRIMs-libs.git
  Description: Libraries for the GRIMs general circulation model

2. GRIMs-srcs
  Path: ./GRIMs/srcs
  URL: https://github.com/GRIMs-NEMO/GRIMs-srcs.git
  Description: Source code for the GRIMs general circulation model

  2-1. GRIMs-chem (submodule within GRIMs-srcs)
    Path: ./GRIMs/srcs/src/chem
    URL: https://github.com/GRIMs-NEMO/GRIMs-chem.git
    Description: Chemistry module for the GRIMs general circulation model

3. GRIMs-runs
  Path: ./GRIMs/runs
  URL: https://github.com/GRIMs-NEMO/GRIMs-runs.git
  Description: Run-time configurations, experiment setups, and job scripts

4. NEMO-for-GRIMs
  Path: ./NEMO
  URL: https://github.com/GRIMs-NEMO/NEMO-for-GRIMs.git
  Description: NEMO ocean model configured for GRIMs coupling

---

## Getting Started

1. Clone this repository with all submodules (including nested):

git clone --recurse-submodules https://github.com/GRIMs-NEMO/GRIMs-NEMO.git

2. If already cloned without --recurse-submodules, run:

git submodule update --init --recursive

